# RESETIUS | 
# RESETIUS |     angle 4
# RESETIUS |     axiom FY-FY-FY-FY-
# RESETIUS | 
# RESETIUS |     F=
# RESETIUS |     Y=FY-FY+FX+FY-FY
# RESETIUS |     X=FA[-Y-Y]+FFX-FX-FXFA[-Y-Y]+F
# RESETIUS |     A=FA+FFX-FXFA+F-
